Spec: Owned XTCP tunnel generation guard

Purpose:
  Keep shared authenticated direct carriers alive across individual stream cancellation and stale tunnel attempts.

Owns:
  ./linkgate_tunnel.go
  ./linkgate_tunnel_test.go

Must:
  Apply only in explicit owned Agent mode and preserve stock session behavior otherwise.
  Retire only the exact carrier observed failing; cancellation or a late failure cannot close a newer or healthy shared carrier.
  Keep a healthy initialized carrier when duplicate hole-punch attempts complete and close the redundant candidate instead of replacing live streams.
  Close late initialization after owner shutdown and retain single ownership of every carrier and UDP listener.
